%% Current hybrid explanation generation in the MCP path.
flowchart TB
    A[Fixed hybrid question<br/>or overall adaptive request]:::interface
    B[MCP client]:::controller
    C[Call predict_depression]:::tool
    D[Prediction context]:::data

    B --> C --> D --> B

    subgraph MCP[MCP tool execution]
        S[explain_shap]:::tool
        R[explain_rag]:::tool
        F[explain_counterfactual]:::tool
    end

    B --> S
    B --> R
    B --> F

    S --> SR[SHAPResult<br/>risk and protective tokens]:::data
    R --> RR[RAGResult<br/>top-k retrieved themes]:::data
    F --> FR[CounterfactualResult<br/>candidate edits and best_cf]:::data

    SR --> X[Raw result set<br/>deserialized in client]:::controller
    RR --> X
    FR --> X
    D --> X
    X --> H[Build HybridResult<br/>_build_hybrid_result]:::controller
    H --> G[generate_hybrid_explanation]:::generator
    G --> L[Gemini final synthesis prompt]:::llm
    L --> O[Comprehensive explanation]:::output

    N[No separate hybrid<br/>MCP server or tool]:::note
    N -. current boundary .-> B

